	["Se pusieron %d ajustes. Las líneas que no eran válidas (%d) se dejaron fuera."] = "%d settings were put on. The lines that weren't valid (%d) were left out.",
	["Siguiente"] = "Next",
	["Tu configuración como texto: guárdalo de respaldo o pásaselo a la manada."] = "Your setup as text: keep it as a backup or pass it to the pack.",
